#. module: purchase_order_secondary_unit
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_order_secondary_unit.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Configure how unit prices and quantities are shown in reports when secondary"
" units are used"
msgstr "副単位使用時の帳票における単価と数量の表示方法を設定します"

#. module: purchase_order_secondary_unit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_order_secondary_unit.field_res_company__secondary_uom_price_display
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_order_secondary_unit.field_res_config_settings__secondary_uom_price_display
msgid ""
"Configure how unit prices are displayed in purchase reports when secondary units are used.\n"
"- Primary Unit Price Only: Shows only the primary unit price\n"
"- Prioritize Secondary Unit Price: Shows secondary unit price when available, falls back to primary otherwise\n"
"- Both: Shows both prices (primary and secondary)"
msgstr ""
"副単位使用時の購買帳票における単価の表示方法を設定します。\n"
"- 主単位単価のみ: 主単位単価のみを表示\n"
"- 副単位単価を優先: 副単位単価がある場合は副単位単価を表示、ない場合は主単位単価を表示\n"
"- 両方: 両方の単価(主単位と副単位)を表示"

